'''Dark Souls (Insane)''' is the first [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stage]], which appears on the '''3rd''' and '''26th''' of each month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is available every Monday.

